# Required-symbol manifest for the shared efi-console fragment.
#
# Intentionally EMPTY: the shared fragment adds NO new enforcement. The native
# worker requires a paired .require manifest for every fragment, so this file
# must exist, but it declares no symbols. Each profile's
# own *.require manifest is unchanged, so removing or changing this fragment
# fails at include-RESOLUTION (file-not-found), never silently at enforcement.
